This licence covers the Vid Sizer application only.

The "all-in-one" distribution additionally bundles ffmpeg.exe and ffprobe.exe,
which are licensed under the GNU General Public License v3 and are NOT covered
by the MIT licence above. Their licence text ships beside them in
ffmpeg\LICENSE.txt, and their source is available from
https://ffmpeg.org/download.html. The application itself contains no ffmpeg
code; it invokes those binaries as separate processes.
